      "writtenOn": "2022-11-08T21:03:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think a mutex is currently needed. I\u0027m expecting that this function is going to be called in an interrupt handler so it should run atomically. However, this function could be called at a point that would interfere with another function that touches control3. I\u0027ve added code to properly restore control3 in that case. I\u0027ve also updated the function\u0027s name and comment to indicate that this function doesn\u0027t have any protection around that register.",
